1
00:00:00,450 --> 00:00:02,450
We might not get seats?!

2
00:00:02,450 --> 00:00:03,780
(Leonard:)It's fine, it's fine.
Go back to sleep.

3
00:00:03,780 --> 00:00:07,500
Oh, I informed you thusly!
I so informed you thusly.

4
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:10,220
(Leonard:)Howard, you talk to him.

5
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:11,390
(Leonard:)Howard?

6
00:00:13,590 --> 00:00:15,230
(Leonard:)You're peeing,
aren't you?

7
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:18,500
(Wil Wheaton:)Hey, look who's here!

8
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:20,260
(Wil Wheaton:)Hey, buddies!

9
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:21,680
(Sheldon:)Well, if it isn't Wil Wheaton,

10
00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:25,800
the Jar Jar Binks
of the Star Trek universe.

11
00:00:25,800 --> 00:00:29,540
Mee-sa think that very funny!

12
00:00:29,540 --> 00:00:33,380
(Sheldon:)Well, you-sa can go think that
at the back of the line.

13
00:00:33,380 --> 00:00:35,950
(Sheldon:)No cuts, no buts, no coconuts.

14
00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:38,000
(Sheldon:)Wil Wheaton.

15
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:39,030
(Penny:)Yeah.

16
00:00:39,030 --> 00:00:40,000
(Theatre Staff:)I'm a big fan.

17
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:43,650
(Sheldon:)Of what? Poorly
executed beards?

18
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:45,720
(Wil:)Do you think you could get me
and my friends into the movie?

19
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:46,990
(Wil:)We got here
a little late.

20
00:00:46,990 --> 00:00:48,830
(Theatre Staff:)No problem. Come on,
I'll hook you up.

21
00:00:48,830 --> 00:00:50,010
(Wil:)Awesome.

22
00:00:51,330 --> 00:00:54,800
(Wil:)We-sa gonna go into
the movie now! Bye-bye!

23
00:00:56,850 --> 00:01:00,970
This is Indiana Jones,
not Star Trek.

